1	# InkOS — Sprint 7 Design Spec: Commissions Engine
2	
3	**From:** Vega (Design Agent)
4	**To:** Koda (Feature Builder)
5	**Date:** 2026-04-15
6	**Stack:** Stack A — Next.js 16.2.3, Tailwind 4, shadcn base-nova, dark-first
7	**Sprint:** 7 — Commissions Engine (Week 16–18)
8	
9	---
10	
11	## 0. Pre-Build Rules (carry all 60 from Sprints 1–6 forward, plus these)
12	
13	61. Migration `20260416000004_commissions.sql` must be confirmed applied before any Sprint 7 UI is written. Tables needed: `commission_rules`, `commission_records`, `commission_adjustments`, `commission_disputes`. All 8 RPCs must be present. Dato confirms readiness before Koda writes line 1.
14	
15	62. **`total_cents` is a GENERATED column** — never include in INSERT or UPDATE payloads. Read from Row type only. Koda must add a lint comment at every `commission_records` upsert site: `// total_cents is GENERATED — omit from writes`.
16	
17	63. **Direct INSERT on `commission_records` and `commission_disputes` is blocked by RLS** (`WITH CHECK (false)`). Use only the RPCs: `approve_commissions`, `cancel_commission`, `recalculate_commission`, `raise_commission_dispute`, `resolve_dispute`. Any `.insert()` call on these tables will throw a 403.
18	
19	64. All money values are stored in cents. Display via `formatCurrency(cents)` from `lib/utils.ts`. `tabular-nums` on every money element. No raw dollar signs with string interpolation.
20	
21	65. `get_studio_commission_dashboard` is `STABLE` — cache with `unstable_cache` TTL 60s. `get_artist_commission_summary` is also `STABLE` — cache TTL 30s (used on artist profile Performance tab where data is expected to be more current).
22	
23	66. **Artist-role data isolation** is enforced at the DB layer via RLS. The UI additionally hides approve/cancel/rule-edit actions when `currentMember.role === 'artist'`. Both layers must be present — never rely on UI alone.
24	
25	67. **Commissions feature gate:** `plans.commissions_enabled` boolean. Check via `useFeatureFlag('commissions')`. On Solo tier, `/commissions` renders `<UpgradeGate variant="inline" feature="commissions" />` (see Section 10). Sidebar item is hidden from the nav entirely for Solo tier — use the same `canDo('commissions.view')` permission pattern from Sprint 6.
26	
27	68. `cancel_commission` is owner-only (not admin). Approve is owner/admin. Recalculate is owner/admin. Raise dispute is artist or owner/admin. Resolve dispute is owner/admin. Enforce in UI via `currentMember.role` checks on action buttons.
28	
29	69. When editing an active commission rule, the spec says: set `effective_until = today - 1 day` on the old rule and INSERT a new rule. This happens in a single Server Action. The old rule row is NOT mutated via direct UPDATE — use the `updateCommissionRule` action which handles the date swap atomically.
30	
31	70. The `CommissionPreview` component is reusable across: rule editor drawer, adjustment modal, and booking creation (Sprint 2 `NewBookingDrawer` enhancement). It is a pure calculation component — no data fetching, all inputs are props.
32	
33	---
34	
35	## 1. New Design Tokens — `app/globals.css`
36	
37	Add to the `@theme inline` block after Sprint 6 tokens:
38	
39	```css
40	/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
41	   COMMISSION RECORD STATUS
42	────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
43	--color-commission-pending:   oklch(70% 0.16 72);     /* amber */
44	--color-commission-approved:  oklch(62% 0.24 292);    /* electric-purple */
45	--color-commission-paid:      oklch(58% 0.18 145);    /* emerald */
46	--color-commission-cancelled: oklch(55% 0.02 264);    /* muted gray */
47	--color-commission-disputed:  oklch(55% 0.22 27);     /* destructive red */
48	
49	/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
50	   COMMISSION ADJUSTMENT KIND
51	────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
52	--color-adj-bonus:       oklch(58% 0.18 145);    /* emerald positive */
53	--color-adj-penalty:     oklch(55% 0.22 27);     /* red negative */
54	--color-adj-correction:  oklch(60% 0.22 230);    /* blue neutral */
55	--color-adj-guest-split: oklch(62% 0.24 292);    /* purple */
56	--color-adj-other:       oklch(60% 0.02 264);    /* neutral */
57	
58	/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
59	   COMMISSION RULE — MATCH TYPE
60	────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
61	--color-rule-service-specific: oklch(62% 0.24 292);   /* purple */
62	--color-rule-catch-all:        oklch(60% 0.22 230);   /* blue */
63	--color-rule-artist-default:   oklch(70% 0.16 72);    /* amber */
64	--color-rule-none:             oklch(55% 0.02 264);   /* muted */
65	
